{
  "id": "ss.terrain.saltplate",
  "name": "Salt plate (SS)",
  "description": "Salt Pan set dressing, and the one cover the pan gives: a plate of salt crust heaved up on its edge, a faceted slab lit hard from above \u2014 bone-white crown, husk-coloured face, an ink underside where it left the ground \u2014 with two cracks across it and grit at its foot. Blocking, radius 16; drawn round-ish so the game's circle capsule fits it. Deliberately angular against everything else on the ground, which is all curves: a plate is the only straight edge on the pan, and a straight edge is what a shot stops at.",
